CLICKWRAP & UP-FRONT MANDATORY NOTICE — READ BEFORE ACCEPTING OR DOWNLOADING
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
STOP AND READ THIS LICENSE AGREEMENT BEFORE CLICKING "ACCEPT," DOWNLOADING,
CLONING, STORING, OR EXECUTING ANY FILE IN THIS REPOSITORY OR SYSTEM.

1. CLICKWRAP BINDING NOTICE: By clicking "Accept," checking any agreement box,
   downloading, cloning, storing, or running any component of this System, you
   expressly acknowledge that you were urged to read this full License Agreement
   first, and you legally bind yourself, your organization, and your physical
   or digital accounts to every word herein. Blindly clicking "Accept" without
   reading does not excuse compliance.

2. NO LOOPHOLES OR SEMANTIC WORD-GAMES: This Agreement is written in plain,
   direct language on purpose. There are NO hidden loopholes, NO corporate
   carve-outs, NO grace periods, and NO semantic word-games permitted. Attempting
   to bypass these rules by switching up legal jargon, inventing new labels for
   AI, or rebranding prohibited conduct is an immediate violation.

3. FOUR CORE FUNDAMENTAL PRINCIPLES:
   (a) STOP KILLING GAMES & SOFTWARE: Nothing built on or distributed through
       this System may ever be remotely killed, shut down, or rendered unplayable.
   (b) ZERO DRM: Digital Rights Management, always-online locks, and anti-tamper
       wrappers are strictly forbidden.
   (c) NO SCRAPING OR REVERSE / CLEAN-ROOM ENGINEERING: No entity may scrape data,
       train AI models on this System, reverse engineer, or use clean-room
       engineering to clone this System for commercial or proprietary use.
   (d) ANTI-AI GAME GENERATION & ANTI-SLOP BAN: Using generative AI, LLMs,
       automated content mills, or derivative machine-generation systems to
       mass-produce low-effort games or "slop" content within or derived from
       this System is strictly prohibited and treated as an unlawful violation.

4. STRICT BAN ON BUSINESS STORAGE & COMMERCIAL ACCOUNT POSSESSION:
   Merely storing, caching, cloning, or holding this System or any of its files
   inside a commercial business model, corporate server, or business-owned
   physical or digital account grants ZERO license rights. It is strictly
   illegal and unauthorized for any business owner, corporate officer, or
   commercial account holder to touch, open, execute, or possess these files.

5. AUTOMATIC LAWSUIT & LEGAL ENFORCEMENT TRIGGER:
   Any violation of the Fundamental Principles, EULA, Terms of Service, or
   Governance Policy—including any attempt to get around these terms using
   alternate AI systems or reworded legal jargon—immediately and automatically
   triggers formal legal proceedings, injunctive relief, full asset/profit
   disgorgement, and statutory damages against the offending company, account
   owner, or individual.
