PART IV: PUBLIC SECTOR & GOVERNMENT GOVERNANCE POLICY

8. Sovereign Partitioning & Critical Infrastructure
   8.1 Compartmentalized Government Modules: Recognized public-sector and
       sovereign defense agencies ("Government Entities") utilizing authorized
       partitions of the System are guaranteed strict cryptographic isolation.
       No private corporation or unauthorized foreign state may view, access,
       or interfere with another sovereign entity's partitioned environment.
   8.2 Utility & Economic Protection: Public infrastructure (power grids, water
       systems, transit, and communications) operating on the System shall
       remain free from private corporate licensing fees, artificial throttling,
       and vendor lock-in, while preserving all civilian Anti-DRM and Anti-
       Obsolescence protections under Part II.

