PART V: ANTI-LOOPHOLE SUPREMACY & AUTOMATIC LAWSUIT TRIGGER

9. Anti-Loophole, Anti-Jargon & Substance-Over-Form Clause
   9.1 No Technicalities or Rewording Defenses: Every section of this Agreement
       shall be enforced according to its plain intent and practical effect.
       No party may escape liability by rewording legal jargon, inventing new
       corporate or technical terminology, routing actions through third-party
       proxies, or exploiting perceived ambiguities in wording.
   9.2 Any Semantic Evasion Is an Independent Breach: Actively attempting to
       relabel prohibited AI tools, reclassify banned business storage, or
       twist legal definitions to evade this Agreement constitutes a separate,
       willful violation on its own.

10. Automatic Lawsuit & Legal Enforcement Trigger
    10.1 Immediate Legal Action Upon Breach: Any company, executive, business
         account owner, organization, or individual that violates any of the
         Four Fundamental Principles (Stop Killing Games, Zero DRM, Anti-Scraping/
         Reverse Engineering, or Anti-AI/Slop), the EULA, the Terms of Service,
         or the Governance Policy automatically and immediately forfeits all
         rights and triggers formal legal enforcement by Raymond Rey Quiles and
         AoberaVoideyStudio.
    10.2 Remedies & Liability: Without any grace period, cure window, or prior
         waiver, the violating party shall be subject to immediate injunctive
         relief, statutory and punitive copyright/contract damages, full
         disgorgement of all revenues or datasets derived from the breach,
         mandatory deletion/destruction of unauthorized copies, and payment of
         100% of the Licensor's attorney fees and court costs.

11. Severability & Maximum Enforcement
    If any single clause of this Agreement is modified or restricted by a court
    of competent jurisdiction, all remaining provisions remain in full force and
    shall be interpreted to provide the maximum legally enforceable protection
    to Raymond Rey Quiles and AoberaVoideyStudio.

